        \end{bmatrix}$. Suppose an $\mathbf{x}$ in $\text{ℝ}^{2}$ has the coordinate vector $\text{[}\mathbf{x}_{B}\text{]} = \left\lbrack \begin{array}{r}
        {- 2} \\
        3
        \end{array} \right\rbrack$. Find $\mathbf{x}$.

Let $\mathbf{b}_{1} = \begin{bmatrix}
        2 \\
