        \end{bmatrix}$, and $B = \left\{ \mathbf{b}_{1}\text{,~}\mathbf{b}_{2} \right\}$. Find the coordinate vector $\left\lbrack \mathbf{x} \right\rbrack_{B}$ of $\mathbf{x}$ relative to $B$.

